# ADR-001: Start with one Formula 1 workload and a reusable platform boundary

- Status: Accepted
- Date: 2026-08-23

## Context

The original concept included Formula 1 and football products, live events, analytics, fantasy features, and a broad learning programme. Building all of these at once would obscure the platform work and make it hard to finish a credible portfolio release.

## Decision

Release 1 will serve Formula 1 historical data only. The platform must provide reusable delivery, infrastructure, observability, and security patterns, but it will support only one application initially.

Football Insights is deferred until Formula Insights can be deployed and operated using these shared patterns.

## Consequences

- The first release has a realistic finish line.
- The project demonstrates platform thinking without pretending to operate a large product organisation.
- Reuse is tested later by onboarding a second workload instead of predicted in advance.
- Product features that do not validate platform capability are intentionally excluded.
